# Bug: 0325-orgs.md 组织数据显示问题修复补丁
# 修复日期: 2023-04-16

## 问题描述
当API返回的组织数据格式与OrgType预期不完全一致时，前端出现报错：
```
Uncaught TypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'path')
```

## 修复的文件
1. projects/app/src/pageComponents/account/team/OrgManage/index.tsx
2. projects/app/src/components/support/permission/MemberManager/MemberModal.tsx
3. projects/app/src/web/support/user/team/org/api.ts

## 修复内容

### 1. 添加非空检查，防止访问undefined对象
在处理orgs.find()结果时，添加对org是否存在的检查，避免访问undefined.path导致的错误。

```diff
# projects/app/src/pageComponents/account/team/OrgManage/index.tsx
      return splitPath
        .map((id) => {
-         const org = orgs.find((org) => org.pathId === id)!;
-
-         if (org.path === '') return;
+         const org = orgs.find((org) => org.pathId === id);
+         
+         if (!org || org.path === '') return;
  
          return {
            parentId: getOrgChildrenPath(org),
            parentName: org.name
          };
        })
```

### 2. 添加对orgs数组是否为空的检查
防止访问空数组的第一个元素：

```diff
# projects/app/src/pageComponents/account/team/OrgManage/index.tsx
      // Auto select the first org(root org is team)
      if (parentPath === '') {
+       if (orgs.length > 0) {
          setParentPath(getOrgChildrenPath(orgs[0]));
+       }
        return [];
      }
```

